<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span><strong>Harbor Master</strong> means that person assigned by the Chief of Portland Fire &amp; Rescue to carry out the duties of Harbor Master. The Chief of Portland Fire &amp; Rescue may assign as many officers as necessary to act as assistants to the Harbor Master in the discharge of their duties or to act as Harbor Master during the absence of the appointed Harbor Master.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-daf5c7d5486316d1995edebbad41d10fbe0565b0abfd79f2b625cc52fbfd4546">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
