        <a href="/code/19/08/010" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">19.08.010  Enforcement.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>All sworn personnel of Portland Fire &amp; Rescue are empowered to arrest or issue citations to any person for violation of any of the provisions of Title 19 and Chapter 830, Oregon Revised Statutes, pertaining to small watercraft.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
