          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/19/10/010" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">19.10.010 Penalties.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>Any person violating any provision or failing to comply with any requirement of this Code, unless provision is otherwise made herein, will upon conviction thereof, be punished by a fine of not more than $500 or by imprisonment for a period of not more than six months, or by both such fine and imprisonment.&nbsp; However, no greater penalty will be imposed than the penalty prescribed by Oregon statute for the same act or omission.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-7cda7322d0b6658290e9382457a5736a7c9ed6056c222ead666ca8236eff1d62">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
